// bscore/bssimplelist_elements.inl: the element types this unit emits BSSimpleList for.
//
// The ten members in bssimplelist.inl are one folded body each for every
// element type. build/units.json gives their addresses to
// bssimplelist_h_unit.cpp, so that unit emits them, once per element type that
// another unit requires. A pointee is forward declared here: the members need
// its name and class-key and nothing else. docs/shared-simple-list.md says
// which element types are listed and which are not.
//
// The list is kept by hand under the rule in that document. Check it again
// whenever a requiring unit changes the class-key of a pointee: the key
// here is the requiring units' key, and another declaration in the tree may
// have the other one (TileCollection in include/fnv/decl, MagicEffectContext
// in include/layout_support.h).

